WEBVTT

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.080
Shark?!

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:18.200
It's just you guys...

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.220
What's up with you?

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.380
Your voice is too loud!

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.660
He's acting a bit different than usual.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:25.920
Are you being followed?

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.790
For <i>him</i> to be on alert like this...

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:29.440
Don't tell me...

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:30.880
Barian?!

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:36.720
Wh-Who <i>is</i> that girl?!

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.100
Oh man, she's just <i>too</i> cute!

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.560
I'm a goner...

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.880
Geez... Ryouga!

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:47.860
I was really looking forward to going to school together.

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:50.780
You ditched me! That's mean!

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:53.540
Ah, you're Shark's little sister!

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:54.530
Rio-<i>san</i>!

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:58.720
From today, I'll be going to school here.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:00.030
Together with my brother, Ryouga.

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:02.750
I'm pleased to make your acquaintance.

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.910
Shark's little sister...?

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:07.000
But... she's nice!

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:11.520
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:17.490
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:20.200
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.550
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:35.630
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:40.140
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:42.510
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:45.730
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:50.270
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.400
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:55.110
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:57.570
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:00.620
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:03.080
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:09.120
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:11.880
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:13.340
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:18.050
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:27.100
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.510
- Cute!
 - Totally my type!

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:40.930
Oh my <i>God</i>!

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:41.470
It's my chance!

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:43.010
S-Seriously?

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.430
But she's so nice!

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:49.060
"Wild Dance of Ice!!
 The Icy Queen, Rio Kamishiro"

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:48.890
In other words, all I have to do is
take away Yuma Tsukumo's Numbers?

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:53.610
Right. And one other thing.
 Ryouga Kamishiro's Numbers as well.

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:55.190
Speaking of which...

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:58.570
Ryouga Kamishiro's sister seems
 to be attending this school as well.

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:02.990
That's right. His little sister is the guy's weak point.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:07.870
In that case, getting our hands on his sister will make it easy to beat down Ryouga Kamishiro!

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:12.380
I understand. All is for the Barian World.

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:14.840
All for the Barian World.

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.840
But, Rio-<i>san</i>, are you sure this is all right?

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:21.840
Coming back to school after
 you've been in the hospital for so long...

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.220
Yes...

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.680
And you know, Ryouga...

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:27.520
He's just so useless without me.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:31.560
He overslept this morning and
 tried to hurry out in his pajamas...

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:33.690
What? Shark overslept?!

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.360
Yes, he also...

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:36.360
Shut up!

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:39.860
Quit blabbering about things you shouldn't talk about!

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:41.780
That's why I don't like you being...

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.570
You... <i>what</i>?

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.200
I-It's nothing.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:49.330
By the way, you...

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:52.790
Are you perhaps the one who beat Ryouga in a Duel?

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.630
Oh? You know me?

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.460
Yes. You're Kaito Tenjo-<i>san</i>, right?

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:01.670
Wrong! I'm Yuma Tsukumo!

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:06.300
Oh! The guy with tremendous
 fighting spirit who wins by dumb luck!

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.430
<i>The</i> Yuma-<i>san</i>?!

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:09.470
What's that mean?!

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:12.560
Um, let's see... You definitely had a catchphrase...

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:13.900
"I'm gonna let 'em rip!"

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.400
"I'm gonna <i>bring it</i> to 'em!"

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.940
Oh wow, so that's what it was.

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:22.110
Sorry for interrupting your lunch time.

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:25.820
Well, I'm looking for... Rio Kamishiro-<i>san</i>.

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.910
Did you need something from me?

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:30.290
I'm the captain of the soccer club, Yata Garasu.

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:34.170
We'd like to make you the manager of our soccer club.

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.790
- Please pay a visit to the tennis team!
- Come to our Judo club!

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:39.300
It would be my honor.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:42.470
Then after school, I will visit everyone's clubs!

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:44.930
Ye... Yes!

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:49.600
Ah... Rio-<i>san</i> is like the sun...

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.430
What a joke.

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:54.890
She's more like a woman of ice than of the sun.

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:56.350
You'll understand eventually.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:01.820
Are you serious?
 She's against all of the regulars by herself!

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:05.320
It seems Rio-<i>san</i> made a bet
 that she will become their manager

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.570
if they manage to steal the ball from her.

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:09.490
That's too risky, or not!

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:12.750
Listen. I expect you to keep your promise.

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:15.500
Of course I will. Here I go!

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:22.260
Amazing!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.130
She's already at the goal?!

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:25.840
Go!

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:42.020
Everyone, you wanted me to be your
 manager with <i>this</i> level of strength?!

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.990
If you want me to be your manager,

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.990
make sure you're strong enough before asking me again.

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:53.410
That was awesome! You had my heart beating!

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.370
Thank you very much.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:56.830
She's not cute at all!

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.670
Just a female Shark.

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.210
What a mean thing to say!

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:04.260
Just leave them be.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:09.140
They're just people who think girls are
 merely pretty decorations.

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:13.180
Nice! Rio-<i>san</i> is my dream woman!

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:15.600
But why are you doing all this?

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:19.560
Because I am Ryouga Kamishiro's sister.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:22.570
Huh? Because you're Shark's sister?

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:27.150
I've heard quite a lot of people don't think very well of Ryouga.

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:29.160
Well... I guess...

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:33.330
If I'm weak, someone might use me as their shield

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.950
to take advantage of Sharks weakness.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:38.410
That's why I need to be strong.

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:40.580
You're Rio Kamishiro-<i>san</i>, aren't you?

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:42.920
Excuse us.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:45.590
The president of our Flower Arrangement club, Aika-<i>sama</i>, wants to see you.

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:49.050
Please come to our club room.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:55.930
Welcome, and thanks for your visit!

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:00.350
I am the president, Aika Hanazoe.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:05.780
You are Rio-<i>san</i>, right?

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:08.110
Looks like you...

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:10.990
... have some outstanding talent.

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:15.410
Cutting them like that... The poor flowers!

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:17.870
The true beauty of a flower...

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:23.000
...only shows when I remove their unwanted parts, right?

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:26.460
Yuma...

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.210
Yuma, Yuma!

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:30.220
Huh?

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.050
Yuma, look around you.

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:38.890
Wha... what on Earth is...

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:44.860
It seems like she is casting a
 hypnosis by cutting the flowers!

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.650
That can't be!

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:48.940
There is only one possible answer.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:52.360
She is an assassin of Barian.

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.410
E...Everyone!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:59.410
As I expected from Yuma Tsukumo.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.120
So you really are...!

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:05.840
For the sake of the Barian World,
 I was planning to go for Rio Kamishiro,

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:09.380
But I guess I must defeat you first after all.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:10.840
What did you say?

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:13.970
If you Duel with me and manage to win,

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:16.470
I will let Rio Kamishiro go.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:18.850
Okay! Then I'll-

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:21.480
Ah, that hurt! My legs fell asleep!

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:24.440
How immature, Yuma Tsukumo!

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:25.730
Darn!

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:27.940
Let me be your opponent!

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:30.570
How?

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.530
You weren't affected by her hypnosis?!

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:37.200
I thought it suspicious and pretended to fall for it.

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.700
You sure play a sly hand.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:43.620
Back off, Sister Shark! This one's a Barian.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:45.710
She's not an opponent you can deal with!

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.130
Is that so?

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:47.670
Huh?

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:50.550
I will defend myself on my own!

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:52.880
I will accept this Duel!

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:56.840
Interesting. Good, let's Duel!

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:02.520
Duel Disk, set!

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:13.280
<i>AR-Vision: Link established.</i>

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.780
Duel!!

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:21.240
I will go first! My turn! Draw!

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:22.870
Here it comes.

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:26.370
I Summon Firearms Flower in Attack Position!

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:36.380
Then I activate a Field Magic from my hand, Zen Garden!

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:41.640
When this card is on the field, attacks from Water-Attribute Monsters will be negated!

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:47.310
Looks like her opponent's deck is specifically designed to counter Shark.

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:51.610
Then, when there is one Plant-Type Monster on my field,

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:55.490
I can Special Summon this Plant-Type Monster from my hand!

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:57.660
Come forth, Artillery Flower!

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:03.830
Then, when there are two or more
 Plant-Type Monsters on my field,

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:08.210
I can Special Summon Cosmos, which is also a Plant-Type, from my hand!

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:14.130
She got three Level Three Monsters right out of the blue!

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:20.050
I Overlay the Level Three Firearms Flower, Artillery Flower, and Cosmos!

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:25.060
I build the Overlay Network with these three Monsters!

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:27.520
Xyz Summon!

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:35.150
Bloom pridefully! Raging Flower Gunboat, Nadeshiko!

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:41.370
Then due to Zen Garden's effect, the Xyz Monster on the field...

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:45.370
... gains 100 Attack Points for every rank it has!

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:49.210
Then I activate Nadeshiko's Monster Effect!

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:53.500
By detaching one Overlay Unit, for every card my opponent has in their hand,

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:56.800
it inflicts 300 points of damage to you!

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:59.510
There are five in your hand,

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:02.680
so please receive 1500 points of damage!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.510
Big Cannon!

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:09.230
That's bad!

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:17.610
I set one card and end my turn!

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:23.660
Here I go! My turn! Draw!

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:26.870
I Summon Blizzard Falcon!

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:34.590
Then, I activate a Magic Card from my hand, Blizzard Jet!

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:41.720
During this turn, one Water-Attribute or Winged-Beast-Type Monster on my field

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:44.680
will gain 1500 Attack Points!

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.140
3000 Attack Points?!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.770
Good job, Shark sister!

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:52.190
Did you forget?

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:54.860
Due to the effect of this field, Zen Garden,

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:58.650
the attacks of Water-Attribute Monsters are negated!

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.110
I didn't forget that.

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:03.240
I activate Blizzard Falcon's effect!

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:07.910
When this card's current Attack Power is higher than its original Attack Power,

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:11.960
I can inflict that exceeded amount as
 damage to the opposing player!

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:15.920
You did it!

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:18.920
So her goal is Effect Damage.

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:21.920
I set three cards and end my turn.

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.430
Rio Kamishiro...

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:30.390
She's better than I expected.

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:32.140
Three set cards...

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:35.730
It seems you are pretty scared
 of Nadeshiko's effect, hmm?

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:40.360
So she's trying to reduce the damage by decreasing her hand?

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:45.450
No, judging from her personality, those set cards should have some meaning to them.

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:50.240
I will make you realize how foolish you are for attempting to shield against me!

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:53.410
My turn! Draw!

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:58.500
I activate the Rank-Up Magic from my hand, Barian's Force!

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:05.130
I rebuild the Overlay Network with Raging Flower Gunship, Nadeshiko!

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:11.060
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:16.980
Now is the time to appear! Great force of Barian!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:23.900
Bloom everywhere!
 Chaos Xyz! Furious Flower Battleship, Taoyame!

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:27.740
Be careful!

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:29.410
No matter what you try...

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:33.330
Due to Zen Garden's effect, the Xyz Monster on the field...

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:37.080
...gains 100 Attack Power for every Rank!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:40.040
I activate Taoyame's Monster Effect!

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.710
By detaching one Chaos Overlay Unit,

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:46.510
for each card on the field, it inflicts 400 points of damage!

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:50.890
There are four cards on your field including your Monster,

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:53.680
and there are three cards on my field!

00:13:56.730 --> 00:14:00.110
Umm... Four and three... which means...

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:01.860
2800 points of damage.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:15.080
Because you fear Nadeshiko's effect,
you set as many cards as you could from your hand, right?

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:20.880
Whoa!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:23.000
What did you do?!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:26.010
Before Taoyame's effect was activated,

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:29.890
I activated my Trap Card, Diamond Dust!

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:34.720
This card destroys all Water-Attribute Monsters on the field!

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:38.520
Thus, there were only two cards on my field,

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.690
for a total of 2000 damage!

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:45.530
Plus, for every Monster this card destroys,

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:47.900
it inflicts 500 points of damage to my opponent!

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:52.070
Isn't she good?!

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.080
But she only has 500 Life left.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:55.790
What a cheap trick!

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:58.660
Then I will finish you off right now!

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:03.130
Take Taoyame's Direct Attack!

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:04.630
Wither away!

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:08.340
I activate the Permanent Trap, Ice Tune!

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:11.300
With this card's effect,

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:16.470
I can Special Summon one Level Four or lower Water-Attribute Monster from my hand!

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:20.520
I Special Summon Aurora Wing in Defense Position!

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:27.530
Once per turn, when Aurora Wing was destroyed by battle,

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:30.780
I can Special Summon it in Defense Position from my Graveyard!

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:34.070
How persistent you are!

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:37.950
I set one card, ending my turn!

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:42.670
Look at you, how you barely held up until now.

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:45.380
I wonder, how much longer can you keep it up?

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:49.720
My turn! Draw!

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:53.220
I activate the Magic Card, Resurrection of the Dead!

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:56.720
I Special Summon Blizzard Falcon from my Graveyard!

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:00.640
I activate the Permanent Trap, Rose Tombstone!

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:05.230
Every time a card activates on the opponent's field,

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:08.280
this card inflicts 300 points of damage to you!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:14.820
What?! At this rate...

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:17.370
Doesn't that mean that she can't activate a card?

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:23.960
I thought you would at least scatter beautifully.

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:28.300
But in the end, you're just the sister of that rude and lowly Ryouga Kamishiro...

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:29.670
...who's got no character at all.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.630
What did you say?

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:38.010
Why don't you...say that again!

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:42.350
Did you say that Ryouga is rude and lowly?

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:48.110
Talk down to <i>me</i>, but I won't tolerate
 you speaking badly of <i>Ryouga</i>!

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:50.440
I will... freeze you.

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:56.490
I Overlay the Level Four Blizzard Falcon and Aurora Wing!

00:16:56.490 --> 00:17:00.450
With these two Monsters, I build the Overlay Network!

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.960
Xyz Summon!

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:10.300
Come forth! Sylphine, the Cold Bird Beast!

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:17.640
What a <i>beautiful</i> Monster you have!

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:20.600
But you still won't defeat me with that!

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:23.850
Is that so? Due to your Zen Garden's effect,

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:28.060
Sylphine gains 100 Attack Points for each rank she has!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.940
Then I activate Sylphine's effect!

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:34.490
By detaching one Overlay Unit, until the end of your next turn,

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:38.240
the effects of all face-up cards 
except this card are negated!

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:40.580
Plus, for every negated card,

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:45.080
it can lower the Attack Power of one Monster my opponent controls by 300 points!

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.670
Perfect Freeze!

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:52.130
There is a total of three face-up cards on your field,

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:56.090
so Taoyame's Attack Power is reduced by 900 points!

00:17:56.090 --> 00:18:00.100
In addition, Zen Garden's effect has been negated,

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:03.310
so the Attack Power gained by their ranks returns to their original values.

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:05.980
With this, your annoying card's been frozen.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.810
Nice! Shark sister!

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:12.900
Will you stop calling me "Shark sister"?!

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:17.950
Umm... Then how about I shorten it to Shark Sis!

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.820
I'll punish you later.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:23.330
Soar, Sylphine!

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:25.830
Attack Taoyame!

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:29.330
How naive! I activate the Quick-Play Magic, Flower Judgment!

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:35.550
Your Monster's effect only targets face-up cards,

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:37.590
I can still use set cards, you know!

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:43.680
This card selects one Plant-Type Xyz Monster on my field...

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:46.810
and sends all its Overlay Units to the Graveyard.

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:51.480
And for each, the Attack Power of my Monster rises by 800!

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:56.030
Now it's got 3100 Attack Points!

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:02.570
Your World of Ice is nothing but a background color for my flower arrangement!

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:05.620
Is that so?

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:09.330
I'll show you the <i>real</i> World of Ice!

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:13.040
From my hand, I activate the Quick-Play Magic, Absolute Zero!

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:19.220
This card turns the Attack Power of one Xyz Monster without Overlay Units to zero!

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:25.930
Absolute Zero is the darkness within pure silver,

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:28.180
and it will shatter all your frozen petals!

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:32.400
How...how could my Chaos Xyz be...

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:35.020
Now, Sylphine! Go forth!

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:36.980
Attack Taoyame!

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:38.990
Ice Ray!

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:05.050
You did it, Shark Sis!

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.980
Ahh, that's no good either?

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:12.190
Then... how... how about...

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:14.230
Sh-Shark <i>Brother</i>!

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:17.860
Yuma, brother refers to "little brother", not "little sister".

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:20.690
Well... Either one's fine!

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:21.700
Anyway...!

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:27.450
While I was in the hospital, Ryouga seems to have changed a lot.

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:30.660
I heard that people have become afraid of him.

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:32.160
I was honestly scared.

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:36.670
But Ryouga didn't change a bit at all.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:41.130
Yuma, it may because you were with him.

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:43.340
M-Me?

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:46.300
Thank you, Yuma!

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:49.770
Rio Kamishiro. I shouldn't let my guard down around her.

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:52.730
I'll get you next time, along with Yuma Tsukumo.

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:02.440
Huh? When did I fall asleep?

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:03.950
Huh? Where's Rio-<i>san</i>?

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:08.160
A so-so Duel, I'd say.

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:09.620
Shark, when did you...?

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.410
Right from the start.

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:13.250
You were watching the whole time?!

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:14.830
Did you need my advice or something?

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:16.120
Hardly!

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:19.800
Oh? You had a Duel while we were sleeping?

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:23.090
Rio-<i>san</i>, please teach me how to Duel one of these days!

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:24.090
It'd be my pleasure.

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:27.260
I think it'd be for the best if you teach her!

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:29.390
Shark, your sister is so amazingly strong!

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:32.520
But she's still quite naive sometimes.

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:37.520
Shark holds a Number,
and Rio makes prophetic remarks...

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:39.480
Just who are the Kamishiro siblings?

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:48.530
A cat! A cat!

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.830
Rio-<i>san</i>, you don't get along with cats?

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:53.040
No way! No way!

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:55.160
Even if it's this cute?

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:57.540
Hurry and make it go away, Ryouga!

00:21:57.540 --> 00:22:00.460
You said you don't need my help, right?

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:01.500
Geez...

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:03.550
Even the scared Rio-<i>sama</i> is...

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:07.430
Ryouga is a meanie!

00:22:17.230 --> 00:22:24.110
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:24.530 --> 00:22:31.780
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:31.780 --> 00:22:39.370
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:39.370 --> 00:22:46.720
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.260 --> 00:23:03.650
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:03.650 --> 00:23:08.450
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.450 --> 00:23:18.790
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:18.790 --> 00:23:27.340
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.340 --> 00:23:32.140
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:38.430
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:42.810
A Duel with Kotori at stake?

00:23:42.810 --> 00:23:44.810
Is he an assassin from Barian, too?

00:23:45.230 --> 00:23:47.070
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:23:47.070 --> 00:23:51.280
"The Ultra-Aggressive One on One Battle!!
Yuma vs. The Unyielding Warrior, Alit"

00:23:51.400 --> 00:23:53.740
Of course I accept the challenge to the Duel!
